    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your feet still ache at the memory of the endless hours you stood watch in the tower. You were trained to keep one eye beyond the wall, on the lookout for raiders charging out of the nearby forest, and the other inside it, searching for pickpockets and troublemakers.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.feats24.Item.phbftAlert000000]{Alert}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Perception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepSpear00000]{Spear}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepLightCross]{Light Crossbow}, 20 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbamoBolts00000]{Bolts}, Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLanternHood]{Hooded Lantern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagManacles000]{Manacles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagQuiver00000]{Quiver}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 12 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
